==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Germanic|fleuhanan|lang=ang}}. Cognates include Old Frisian {{term|flia}}, Old High German {{term|fliohan|lang=goh}} (German {{term|fliehen|lang=de}}), Old Saxon {{term|fliohan|lang=osx}} (Dutch {{term|vlieden|lang=nl}}), Old Norse {{term|flýja|lang=non}}, Gothic {{term|𐌸𐌻𐌹𐌿𐌷𐌰𐌽|lang=got|sc=Goth}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fleːon/|lang=ang}}

